      "evidence": "CreateCastBar creates the StatusBar inside castbarBg and assigns frame.Castbar; SetupShowOnCastBar owns native visibility. Resource Bars creates ERB_CastBarFrame._bar (ERB_CastBar) inside a clipping frame, with _border above it. Main Player discovery prefers this live bar, then the Unit Frames mini cast. UF_CastbarAspectTemplate opts Blizzard-style holders into DisableUntrustedLayoutScriptsTemplate; _blizzArtFr/_classicArt draw above the native bar."
